# Fedora policy, not an upstream-provided preset: activation remains opt-in.
# Upstream's explicit enable step:
# https://github.com/xremap/xremap/blob/23e880d441bf968de396c731fdcea18b1af62d9b/doc/running_as_system_service.md#autostart-xremap-at-boot
# Format: https://www.freedesktop.org/software/systemd/man/latest/systemd.preset.html
disable xremap.service
disable xremap-bridge.service
